From 87bd9fec8e840b14f659fb6f3db4db059bd071c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: will <will-tm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:41:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] hw/usb: CI HDRC device-mode UDC for i.MX6SX

Expose the i.MX6SX ChipIDEA peripheral controller through a chardev
host bridge and wire it into the flintstone machine.
---
 hw/arm/flintstone.c          |  54 +++-
 hw/arm/fsl-imx6sx.c          |  24 +-
 hw/usb/cihdrc-udc.c          | 542 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 hw/usb/imx-usbmisc.c         |  80 ++++++
 hw/usb/meson.build           |   1 +
 include/hw/arm/fsl-imx6sx.h  |   7 +-
 include/hw/usb/cihdrc-udc.h  |  32 +++
 include/hw/usb/imx-usbmisc.h |  16 ++
 8 files changed, 748 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 hw/usb/cihdrc-udc.c
 create mode 100644 hw/usb/imx-usbmisc.c
 create mode 100644 include/hw/usb/cihdrc-udc.h
 create mode 100644 include/hw/usb/imx-usbmisc.h

